.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-changelog \- Generate changelogs from your project's commit history.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab changelog  [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Generate changelogs from commits in your project's Git repository.
Changelog entries are built from commits that include a configured Git
trailer, such as 'Changelog'.

.PP
For more information about how GitLab generates changelogs, see
Changelogs
\[la]https://docs.gitlab.com/user/project/changelogs/\[ra]\&.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab(1)\fP, \fBglab-changelog-generate(1)\fP
